      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W2156_Task5" name="System flags cards reaching the 5-year-expiry window (per RA 7394 /…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: System flags cards reaching the 5-year-expiry window (per RA 7394 / consumer-protection practice); daily batch processes the expired balance to breakage revenue per PFRS 15 (Dr. Gift Card Liability / Cr. Breakage Revenue)
Responsible (R): System / Finance
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: Daily</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2156_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2156_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2156_Task6" name="Finance Manager performs monthly breakage analysis: actual breakage rate vs…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Finance Manager performs monthly breakage analysis: actual breakage rate vs. the PFRS 15 expected-breakage estimate; adjusts the estimate if the actual diverges; reconciles the liability balance to the outstanding-card registry
Responsible (R): Finance Manager
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2156_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
