    <bpmn:process id="W_W5548" name="W5548. Stored-Value &amp; Loyalty Platform Outage, Downtime-Acceptance &amp; Manual-Redemption Protocol" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: The gift-card/stored-value platform or the loyalty points engine is unavailable at POS or online for more than 30 minutes during trading — balance verification, redemption, earn, or reload failure affecting customer tenders and benefits
Frequency: ~2–5 unplanned events/yr chain-wide (planned maintenance windows are excluded — those ride the standard release calendar with pre-announced downtime)
Volume: 1 event × the redemption population (gift-card tender share of 2.8M monthly POS transactions plus the loyalty-attached majority of baskets) × the liability surface: outstanding gift-card balances plus unredeemed points liability across the program
Owner: Category Manager (Gift Cards) / CRM-Loyalty Manager (points engine)
Participants: Store Managers &amp; Front-End, Customer Service (VS-13 desk), IT incident management (root cause), Finance (liability postings per W28-class), Loss Prevention (manual-mode abuse watch), Marketing (customer messaging), Ecommerce (online redemption holds)
Source: workflow W5548 — Stored-Value &amp; Loyalty Platform Outage, Downtime-Acceptance &amp; Manual-Redemption Protocol</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5548_LaneSet7">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5548_Lane1" name="IT">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5548_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5548_Start8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5548_Lane2" name="Category Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5548_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5548_Lane3" name="Front-End">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5548_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5548_Lane4" name="LP">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5548_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5548_Lane5" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5548_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5548_Task15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5548_Lane6" name="Customer Service">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5548_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5548_End16</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5548_Start8" name="The gift-card/stored-value platform or the loyalty points engine is unavailable at POS or…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5548_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5548_Task9" name="Outage scope &amp; mode">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Outage scope &amp; mode: confirm which functions failed (balance-verify only / redeem / earn / reload) and which surfaces (POS, online, both); open the event log; classify expected duration with IT (transient glitch vs platform incident)
Responsible (R): IT / CRM-Loyalty Manager
Accountable (A): Category Manager (Gift Cards)
Duration: &lt; 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5548_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5548_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5548_Task10" name="Downtime-acceptance decision">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Downtime-acceptance decision per the pre-approved exposure matrix: (a) balance-verify only → honor displayed/last-known balance up to the per-card cap (default PHP 5,000) with ID capture; (b) redemption-engine down → suspend gift-card and points redemption, accept earn retroactively (points post on recovery); (c) full-platform down → manual-redemption mode (Step 3) below the cap only for customers with physical card/receipt evidence
Responsible (R): Category Manager (Gift Cards) / CRM-Loyalty Manager
Accountable (A): VP Marketing (program) / CFO (liability)
Duration: &lt; 30 min of Step 1</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5548_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5548_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5548_Task11" name="Manual-redemption execution">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manual-redemption execution: POS manual-voucher mode — paper voucher + card number + valid ID recorded, receipt annotated &quot;manual redemption — outage&quot;, cap enforced at the till; online orders with gift-card tender held (not cancelled) pending recovery
Responsible (R): Front-End / Cashier
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: During outage</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5548_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5548_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5548_Task12" name="Fraud watch during manual mode">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Fraud watch during manual mode: LP monitors serial manual redemptions, cap-adjacent claims and no-balance-card patterns; suspected-abuse cases refused politely with escalation script; all manual vouchers retained for batch entry
Responsible (R): LP / Duty Supervisors
Accountable (A): Loss Prevention Director
Duration: During outage</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5548_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5548_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5548_Task13" name="Recovery &amp; catch-up posting">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Recovery &amp; catch-up posting: platform restore verified in canary store first; paper vouchers batch-entered; earn-posting reconciliation for the outage window (every basket that earned but could not post); duplicate-redemption sweep (cards manually redeemed that also posted electronically)
Responsible (R): Finance / CRM-Loyalty Manager
Accountable (A): Category Manager (Gift Cards)
Duration: 1–2 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5548_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5548_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5548_Task14" name="Customer remediation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Customer remediation: missed-points claims accepted with POS receipt evidence via Customer Service (no-questions window of 14 days); goodwill points per policy where a refusal occurred; online held orders released or refunded per customer choice
Responsible (R): Customer Service / CRM-Loyalty Manager
Accountable (A): VP Marketing
Duration: 1–2 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5548_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5548_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5548_Task15" name="Liability true-up &amp; post-mortem">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Liability true-up &amp; post-mortem: points/gift-card liability accounts trued-up for the manual-mode exposure and catch-up postings; variance beyond tolerance investigated; post-mortem with IT covers RTO/RPO targets for the platform, the maintenance-window policy, and any matrix cap adjustments
Responsible (R): Finance / IT
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1–2 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5548_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5548_End16" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5548_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5548_Annotation17">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-392 (ensure controlled execution — Gift Card Redemption &amp; Balance Management (PA-54.2).) | - operational: manual redemption never exceeds the pre-approved per-card cap without VP Marketing + CFO sign-off; every manual voucher batch-enters before the liability true-up closes | - operational: every outage event closes with the earn-posting reconciliation evidenced (no silent points loss)
Owner: Category Manager (Gift Cards) / CRM-Loyalty Manager (points engine)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5548_Assoc18" sourceRef="W5548_Annotation17" targetRef="W5548_Start8" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5548_Flow19" sourceRef="W5548_Start8" targetRef="W5548_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5548_Flow20" sourceRef="W5548_Task9" targetRef="W5548_Task10" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5548_Flow21" sourceRef="W5548_Task10" targetRef="W5548_Task11" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5548_Flow22" sourceRef="W5548_Task11" targetRef="W5548_Task12" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5548_Flow23" sourceRef="W5548_Task12" targetRef="W5548_Task13" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5548_Flow24" sourceRef="W5548_Task13" targetRef="W5548_Task14" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5548_Flow25" sourceRef="W5548_Task14" targetRef="W5548_Task15" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5548_Flow26" sourceRef="W5548_Task15" targetRef="W5548_End16" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W5548_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W5548_plane" bpmnElement="W_W5548">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W5548_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W5548_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="1790" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W5548_Lane2_di" bpmnElement="W5548_Lane2" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="250" width="1790" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W5548_Lane3_di" bpmnElement="W5548_Lane3" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="420" width="1790" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W5548_Lane4_di" bpmnElement="W5548_Lane4" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="590" width="1790" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W5548_Lane5_di" bpmnElement="W5548_Lane5" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="760" width="1790" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W5548_Lane6_di" bpmnElement="W5548_Lane6" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="930" width="1790" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W5548_Task9_di" bpmnElement="W5548_Task9"><dc:Bounds x="400" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W5548_Task10_di" bpmnElement="W5548_Task10"><dc:Bounds x="610" y="295" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W5548_Task11_di" bpmnElement="W5548_Task11"><dc:Bounds x="820" y="465" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W5548_Task12_di" bpmnElement="W5548_Task12"><dc:Bounds x="1030" y="635" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
